  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Caritas Rabat Morocco Earthquake response</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contribution to EA for Morocco earthquake response project  (euro 518,00) to provide immediate response to affected families over a period of 4 - 5 months.  The principal objectives of the project are to: 
provide transitional shelters to most vulnerable affected families; 
provide latrines to spontaneous camps and transitional shelters and 
Provide hygiene promotion to the affected population.  
provide winterisation kits to families living in tents or damaged houses</narrative>
  </description>
